{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Closed forms of the clean coefficients: $[2,1,0]^{\\otimes2}$ (generic in $\\Lambda$)\n\n**Goal.** Express the clean combinations of the site-1 insertions in closed form: as rational functions of $t=\\theta_{12}/h$ for multiplicity-1 sectors, and through the copy's own spectral data in multiplicity sectors. The fitted clean spaces of `Minimal-ingredients-*-EH.wb` are the null spaces of the leading contamination vectors $k_B$, so it is enough to find $k_B$ in closed form.\n\n**Setup.** $h=1$, $\\theta=(t,0)$, so everything depends on $t$ alone (by homogeneity). The insertions are the site-1-local $T_\\lambda(\\theta_1-\\lambda_1h)$ given by the unified rule ($d=\\Lambda_1-\\Lambda_2$; $T_{(k,k)}$ for $k\\le d$, $T_{(k,d)}$ for $k>d$). Their covectors are the $f$-free one-site form $c_\\lambda=\\langle v_\\lambda|R^{-1}\\otimes e_1^T$, and they are top-killed.\n\n**Removing $\\varepsilon$ exactly.** Per state, compute the normalized directions $k_B/k_{B,\\rm ref}$ and $s_B/s_{B,\\rm ref}$, the scale $K_{\\rm ref}/S_{\\rm ref}$, and the eigenvalue $\\lambda_B$ of $t_2(u_0)$, at $\\varepsilon,2\\varepsilon,4\\varepsilon$. Richardson extrapolation then gives the $\\varepsilon\\to0$ values up to $O(\\varepsilon^3)$.\n\n**Fit.** Each component is fitted as $p(t)/q(t)$ over about 20 values of $t$, at the lowest total degree that fits, with rationalized coefficients. The fit is then validated on held-out values of $t$. In multiplicity sectors, each component is tested in the form $A(t)+B(t)\\lambda_c$, with $\\lambda_c$ the copy's untwisted $t_2(u_0)$ eigenvalue.\n\nThis notebook is the control: for $[2,1,0]$ the singlet coefficient $\\beta(t)$ is known (`Adjoint-clean-analytic.wb`).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh kernel: clears Global` for every notebook sharing this kernel (their files are untouched) *)\nClearAll @@ Select[Names[\"Global`*\"], FreeQ[Attributes[#], Protected] &];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators, verbatim from the clean L=1 notebook *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\n(* ---- the rep ---- *)\nΛ = {2, 1, 0};\nd1 = dim[Λ]; d2 = d1^2; id1 = IdentityMatrix[d1]; idm2 = IdentityMatrix[d2, SparseArray]; pr = 200;\n(* h = 1 and θ = (t, 0): everything depends on t only; setPoint (next cell) moves t *)\nhN = 1; thN = {5/2, 0};\nMsolEH = Module[{Mv = Array[mm, d1]}, Mv /. First[Solve[Join[Thread[DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Table[DiagonalMatrix[Mv] . JJ[j, i, Λ] - Transpose[JJ[i, j, Λ]] . DiagonalMatrix[Mv], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]], 0] == 0], {mm[1] == 1}], Mv]]];\nRd = Sqrt[MsolEH];\nEe[i_, j_] := Ee[i, j] = DiagonalMatrix[Rd] . JJ[i, j, Λ] . DiagonalMatrix[1/Rd];\nEN[i_, j_] := EN[i, j] = N[Ee[i, j], pr];\nEtotN[i_, j_] := EtotN[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[EN[i, j]], SparseArray[id1]] + KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[id1], SparseArray[EN[i, j]]];\nwtBasis = Flatten[Table[Table[J0[k][p1] + J0[k][p2], {k, 3}], {p1, ps[{Λ}]}, {p2, ps[{Λ}]}], 1];\nsecOf[μ_] := secOf[μ] = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, μ]];\nkron[a_, b_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[a, b]];\ne1 = UnitVector[d1, 1]; e11 = kron[e1, e1];\nnexp[A_] := id1 + Sum[MatrixPower[A, k]/k!, {k, 1, 2 (Λ[[1]] - Λ[[3]])}];\nactRR[g_, v_] := Flatten[g . Partition[v, d1] . Transpose[g]];\nGrid[{{\"Λ\", Λ}, {\"one-site, two-site dimension\", {d1, d2}}, {\"precision\", pr}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"62\" data-out-n=\"811\" data-sub-idx=\"25\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"30\" data-sub-end=\"30\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[811]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcTGFtYmRhICAmIFxsZWZ0XHsyLDEsMFxyaWdodFx9XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtvbmUtc2l0ZSwgdHdvLXNpdGUgZGltZW5zaW9ufSAmIFxsZWZ0XHs4LDY0XHJpZ2h0XH1cXFxobGluZVx0ZXh0e3ByZWNpc2lvbn0gJiAyMDBcXFxobGluZVxlbmR7YXJyYXl9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">one-site, two-site dimension</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">precision</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
