c0,28,1.7,43,3.3,45l0,2409\nc-3,4,-3.3,16.7,-3.3,38c0,162,-5.7,313.7,-17,455c-18.7,248,-55.8,469.3,-111.5,664\nc-55.7,194.7,-131.8,370.3,-228.5,527c-20.7,34.7,-41.7,66.3,-63,95c-2,3.3,-4,7,-6,11\nc0,7.3,5.7,11,17,11c0,0,11,0,11,0c9.3,0,14.3,-0.3,15,-1c5.3,-5.3,10.3,-11,15,-17\nc242.7,-294.7,395.3,-681.7,458,-1161c21.3,-164.7,33.3,-350.7,36,-558\nl0,-2544c-2,-159.3,-10,-310.7,-24,-454c-53.3,-528,-210,-949.7,\n-470,-1265c-4.7,-6,-9.7,-11.7,-15,-17c-0.7,-0.7,-6.7,-1,-18,-1z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.042738</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[846]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{[t1, t2] residual} & 0.\\times 10^{-192}\\\\\\hline\\text{HW-limit states found / HW states} & \\left\\{6,6\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{HW sectors (multiplicity)} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & 1\\\\\\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\} & 1\\\\\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & 1\\\\\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & 2\\\\\\left\\{2,2,2\\right\\} & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{time (s)} & 0.042738\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "69d4b3e4-06ba-4884-a2ce-ee39b86cbd23"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Leading contamination and signal data, extrapolated to $\\varepsilon\\to0$\nFor state $B$ (weight $\\mu$, copy $c$), with top-killed insertions $d_\\lambda$:\n- $K_B=d\\cdot(R\\otimes R)\\Psi_\\perp$ and $S_B=d\\cdot P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi$;\n- normalized directions $\\hat k=K/K_{\\rm ref}$ and $\\hat s=S/S_{\\rm ref}$, and the scale $\\rho=K_{\\rm ref}/S_{\\rm ref}$;\n- $\\lambda_B=t_2(u_0)$ eigenvalue, with $u_0=2/9$.\n\nThe reference insertions are fixed per state at the first $t$. Each quantity is computed at $\\varepsilon_0,2\\varepsilon_0,4\\varepsilon_0$ ($\\varepsilon_0=10^{-8}$) and Richardson-extrapolated: $f_0=(8f(\\varepsilon_0)-6f(2\\varepsilon_0)+f(4\\varepsilon_0))/3$. The check compares $\\varepsilon_0$ with $\\varepsilon_0/2$, which estimates the remaining error. A state with $|\\rho|=O(\\varepsilon)$ is already clean for every insertion.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "dd = Λ[[1]] - Λ[[2]];\nlocShapes = Join[Table[{k, k}, {k, dd}], Table[{k, dd}, {k, dd + 1, Λ[[1]]}]]; nL = Length[locShapes];\nuLoc := thN[[1]] - Λ[[1]] hN;\ncLam[λ_, zv_, wv_] := kron[(Om1[zv, wv] . TL1[1, λ, uLoc, DiagonalMatrix[zv]]) . RrotInv[zv, wv], e1];\ndVecs[zv_, wv_] := (# - (# . e11) e11) & /@ Table[cLam[λ, zv, wv], {λ, locShapes}];\nu0 = 2/9;\nrawKS[μ_, c_, ε_] := Module[{zv = zOf[ε, φ], wv = wOf[ε, ω], Ψ, Ψhw, ds}, Ψ = pickState[μ, c, zv][\"psi\"]; Ψhw = projHW[μ, Ψ]; ds = dVecs[zv, wv];\n   {ds . actRR[Rrot[zv, wv], Ψ - Ψhw], ds . Ψhw, tEv[Ψ, 2, u0, zv]}];\nrich3[f1_, f2_, f4_] := (8 f1 - 6 f2 + f4)/3;\nε0 = 10^-8;\n(* the Richardson-extrapolated vector {k-hat (nL), s-hat (nL), ρ, λ} *)\nleadAt[μ_, c_, ref_, e0_] := Module[{d = Table[rawKS[μ, c, m e0], {m, {1, 2, 4}}], f},\n   f[i_] := With[{K = d[[i, 1]], S = d[[i, 2]]}, Join[K/K[[ref[[1]]]], S/S[[ref[[2]]]], {K[[ref[[1]]]]/S[[ref[[2]]]], d[[i, 3]]}]];\n   rich3[f[1], f[2], f[3]]];\nrefOf[μ_, c_] := With[{r = rawKS[μ, c, ε0]}, {Ordering[Abs[r[[1]]], -1][[1]], Ordering[Abs[r[[2]]], -1][[1]]}];\n(* accuracy check at the current point: ε0 against ε0/2 *)\nrefs = Association[Table[μc -> refOf @@ μc, {μc, nonTop}]];\n{tA, acc} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{a = leadAt[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], refs[μc], ε0], b = leadAt[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], refs[μc], ε0/2]},\n     {μc, locShapes[[refs[μc][[1]]]], N[a[[2 nL + 1]], 6], N[Max[Abs[a - b]/Max[1, Abs[a]]], 3], Round[Precision[a]]}], {μc, nonTop}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"state {μ, copy}\", \"K_ref insertion\", \"ρ = K_ref/S_ref (t = 5/2)\", \"max |lead(ε0) - lead(ε0/2)|\", \"digits\"}}, acc, {{\"insertions\", locShapes, \"\", \"time (s)\", tA}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
