\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.630381</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[860]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{state \\{$\\mu$, copy\\}} & \\text{K\\_ref insertion} & \\text{$\\rho$ = K\\_ref/S\\_ref (t = 5/2)} & \\text{max |lead($\\varepsilon$0) - lead($\\varepsilon$0/2)|} & \\text{digits}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\},1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & 5.00725\\times 10^{-25} & 1.54\\times 10^{-25} & 0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\},1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & -2.92833\\times 10^{-25} & 5.04\\times 10^{-25} & 146\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\},1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & -2.06510\\times 10^{-25} & 1.49\\times 10^{-25} & 145\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\},2\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & -8.72142\\times 10^{-27} & 1.37\\times 10^{-25} & 144\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{2,2,2\\right\\},1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & 0.666667 & 2.20\\times 10^{-25} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{insertions} & \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 1\\\\2 & 1\\end{pmatrix} &  & \\text{time (s)} & 0.630381\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "0b219b41-5a97-4de5-895a-ab15c5575d74"
    }
