  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Scan over $t$ and rational fits\nThere are 20 fit points and 5 validation points, all non-integer and non-half-integer rationals. Multiplicity sectors use copy 1's reference insertions for every copy, so the copies' data are directly comparable. A state is **already clean** when $|\\rho|<10^{-15}$ at every $t$.\n\n`ratFit` finds the lowest total degree $(m,n)$ with $p_m(t)/q_n(t)$ ($q$ monic) fitting the 20 points to $10^{-18}$. It rationalizes the coefficients and accepts the result only if the exact rational function reproduces the 5 held-out points to $10^{-15}$.\n\nIn a multiplicity sector, each quantity $a_c$ of copy $c$ is tested in the form $a_c=A(t)+B(t)\\lambda_c$ (multiplicity 2), with $A,B$ fitted. The elementary symmetric functions of the $\\lambda_c$ are fitted too.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "tFit = {23/7, 31/9, 41/11, 19/13, 37/17, 53/19, 29/23, 61/12, 47/15, 13/4, 71/16, 22/9, 58/13, 17/11, 83/19, 34/7, 67/20, 44/17, 79/14, 25/8};\ntVal = {39/10, 27/11, 51/13, 73/18, 33/7}; tAll = Join[tFit, tVal];\nsetPoint[tAll[[1]]];\nrefs = Association[Table[μc -> refOf @@ μc, {μc, Select[nonTop, #[[2]] == 1 &]}]];\nScan[(refs[#] = refs[{#[[1]], 1}]) &, Select[nonTop, #[[2]] > 1 &]];\n{tD, data} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[setPoint[t]; Association[Table[μc -> leadAt[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], refs[μc], ε0], {μc, nonTop}]], {t, tAll}]];\n(* rational fit in t, validated on held-out points *)\nratFit[ys_] := Module[{ts = tFit, yf = Take[ys, Length[tFit]], yv = Drop[ys, Length[tFit]], nf = Length[tFit]},\n   If[Max[Abs[ys]] < 10^-20, Return[{0, 0, 0}]];\n   Catch[Do[Do[With[{n = dg - m}, Module[{A, b, sol, r, f, X},\n         A = Table[Join[Table[ts[[i]]^k, {k, 0, m}], Table[-yf[[i]] ts[[i]]^k, {k, 0, n - 1}]], {i, nf}];\n         b = yf ts^n; sol = LeastSquares[A, b]; r = Max[Abs[A . sol - b]]/Max[1, Max[Abs[b]]];\n         If[r < 10^-18, sol = Rationalize[sol, 10^-15];\n          f = Function[x, Evaluate[Sum[sol[[k + 1]] x^k, {k, 0, m}]/(x^n + Sum[sol[[m + 2 + k]] x^k, {k, 0, n - 1}])]];\n          Throw[{Factor[f[T]], dg, N[Max[Abs[(f /@ tVal) - yv]], 3]}]]]], {m, 0, dg}], {dg, 0, nf - 3}]; {\"no fit\", -1, -1}]];\nqName[j_] := Which[j <= nL, \"k\" <> ToString[locShapes[[j]]], j <= 2 nL, \"s\" <> ToString[locShapes[[j - nL]]], j == 2 nL + 1, \"ρ\", True, \"λ\"];\ncleanQ[μc_] := Max[Abs[Table[d[μc][[2 nL + 1]], {d, data}]]] < 10^-15;\n(* multiplicity-1 sectors: fit every quantity directly; skip k-hat and ρ for already-clean states, and λ *)\nsingles = Select[nonTop, Length[hwB[#[[1]]]] == 1 &];\nfits1 = Flatten[Table[With[{js = If[cleanQ[μc], Range[nL + 1, 2 nL], Range[1, 2 nL + 1]]},\n     Table[With[{ft = ratFit[Table[d[μc][[j]], {d, data}]]}, {μc[[1]], If[cleanQ[μc], \"clean\", \"contaminated\"], qName[j], ft[[1]], ft[[2]], ft[[3]]}], {j, js}]], {μc, singles}], 1];\n(* multiplicity-2 sectors: a_c = A + B λ_c *)\nmult2 = Select[hwSecs, Length[hwB[#]] == 2 &];\nfits2 = Flatten[Table[Module[{d1v = Table[d[{μ, 1}], {d, data}], d2v = Table[d[{μ, 2}], {d, data}], l1, l2, cl},\n     l1 = d1v[[All, -1]]; l2 = d2v[[All, -1]]; cl = cleanQ[{μ, 1}] && cleanQ[{μ, 2}];\n     Join[{With[{f1 = ratFit[l1 + l2], f2 = ratFit[l1 l2]}, {μ, \"λ1+λ2, λ1λ2\", \"sym\", {f1[[1]], f2[[1]]}, {f1[[2]], f2[[2]]}, {f1[[3]], f2[[3]]}}]},\n      Table[With[{B = (d1v[[All, j]] - d2v[[All, j]])/(l1 - l2)}, With[{A = d1v[[All, j]] - B l1}, With[{fA = ratFit[A], fB = ratFit[B]},\n          {μ, If[cl, \"clean\", \"contaminated\"], qName[j], {fA[[1]], fB[[1]]}, {fA[[2]], fB[[2]]}, {fA[[3]], fB[[3]]}}]]], {j, If[cl, Range[nL + 1, 2 nL], Range[1, 2 nL + 1]]}]]], {μ, mult2}], 1];\nColumn[{Grid[Join[{{\"μ (mult 1)\", \"status\", \"quantity\", \"closed form in t\", \"total degree\", \"validation error\"}}, fits1], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n  Grid[Join[{{\"μ (mult 2)\", \"status\", \"quantity\", \"{A(t), B(t)} in a_c = A + B λ_c\", \"degrees\", \"validation errors\"}}, fits2], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n  Grid[{{\"data time (s)\", tD}}, Frame -> All]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
